-- 20260921100100_towns_data.sql
--
-- Loads 17,564 Sri Lankan towns into public.towns.
--
-- SOURCE: GeoNames gazetteer extract LK.zip, downloaded 2026-09-21.
-- LICENCE: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
--          ATTRIBUTION REQUIRED in the app wherever town data is shown.
--
-- CLEANING (reproducible from LK.txt):
--   * Populated places (feature class P), excluding PPLQ (abandoned). 17,838 rows.
--   * District: GeoNames admin2 where present. For the 278 rows without one - which
--     includes every regional capital (Kandy, Galle, Jaffna, Trincomalee, ...) - the
--     district of the nearest GN-division point (ADM4, 14,018 points). Validated
--     against the rows WITH a stated district: 99.3% agreement, median 0.62 km to the
--     nearest GN point. The province code on those same rows is frequently wrong and
--     is not used.
--   * DS division: from the nearest GN-division point.
--   * Merged: same name + same district within 3 km (71 rows), then one row per
--     name + district + DS division (the residual same-division clashes).
--   * Label: "Town, District"; "Town (DS division), District" where the name repeats
--     within a district; bare "Town" where the town and district share a name.
--   * Rank (higher shows first): admin seats; places with a population figure (only
--     ~92 have one); places that share their DS division's name.
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING.

ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

